WEBVTT

00:23.080 --> 00:24.680
[students] T is for teachers

00:24.760 --> 00:28.960
who always encourage students
to seek knowledge.

00:29.040 --> 00:32.640
They plant a seed
so it will become strong like trees.

00:33.160 --> 00:37.960
Even when they're tired, they never stop
working for the students.

00:38.040 --> 00:43.440
They stick with the right discipline
to find the principle of education.

00:44.720 --> 00:49.280
They are the role models
for being good citizens of the earth.

00:49.360 --> 00:52.800
They make us believe in a better world.

00:52.880 --> 00:56.000
Today, as we throw
our farewell party for Kwan,

00:56.080 --> 00:59.840
we will also announce the winner
of the best teacher award this year,

00:59.920 --> 01:03.160
who will also be named
the new deputy director.

01:03.720 --> 01:05.800
This award goes to…

01:15.040 --> 01:16.000
Excuse me, Aum.

01:16.800 --> 01:18.120
What are you doing here?

01:18.200 --> 01:24.320
[humming "Twelve Days of Christmas"]

01:24.400 --> 01:25.360
[all screaming]

01:25.440 --> 01:28.560
[Nanno] T is for teachers
who teach ethics to others.

01:28.640 --> 01:29.520
[humming continues]

01:29.600 --> 01:30.440
[gun cocks]

01:30.520 --> 01:31.480
[gunshot]

01:34.520 --> 01:37.880
[theme music]

02:50.440 --> 02:52.400
-[Pim] Good morning.
-[female student] Good morning.

02:52.480 --> 02:54.880
[female student] mom wanted me
to give you this. It's a hand cream.

02:55.520 --> 02:56.800
They say it's very good.

02:56.880 --> 02:58.440
Please thank your mother for me.

02:58.520 --> 02:59.600
Sure. See you in class.

03:03.760 --> 03:05.320
-Hey, you.
-Yes?

03:05.400 --> 03:06.920
You were almost late today.

03:07.000 --> 03:09.520
My girlfriend and I stayed up late.
We started watching a new TV show.

03:09.600 --> 03:10.440
[Pim chuckles]

03:10.520 --> 03:13.480
And what about you?
Do you have any TV shows you like?

03:15.560 --> 03:17.000
I have no time for that.

03:18.640 --> 03:19.840
[Man] I thought as much.

03:19.920 --> 03:21.720
All you do is work, right?

03:24.080 --> 03:26.000
I don't mind working hard. I like it.

03:26.880 --> 03:29.400
But it's ridiculous
for us to stand here like this.

03:29.960 --> 03:30.800
Like you know,

03:30.880 --> 03:33.440
greeting the students is a great ways
to teach them good manners.

03:34.560 --> 03:37.400
Is it still good manners
if they're forced to do it?

03:37.480 --> 03:38.480
[Man sighs]

03:46.920 --> 03:48.280
Good morning.

03:48.880 --> 03:51.040
Are you the new student in classroom F?
What's your name?

03:51.960 --> 03:53.160
I'm Nanno.

03:53.880 --> 03:56.320
[foreboding music playing]

04:06.440 --> 04:09.240
[director] Good morning,
teachers and students.

04:09.320 --> 04:12.320
I have an important announcement
for everyone this morning.

04:12.400 --> 04:17.000
After this academic year, Kwan,
our deputy director, will retire.

04:17.079 --> 04:21.240
Our school will throw her
a retirement party at the end of the year.

04:21.320 --> 04:23.240
There's another announcement
I want to make.

04:23.800 --> 04:26.440
Our school has conducted
a survey of the students.

04:27.000 --> 04:30.080
It can't be denied by anyone
that there is one question

04:30.160 --> 04:35.040
in particular on this survey,
that everyone seems to be interested in.

04:35.120 --> 04:38.640
The vote for the most popular teacher.

04:38.720 --> 04:41.440
The teacher who wins
the best teacher award this year

04:41.520 --> 04:43.760
will receive a special prize

04:43.840 --> 04:46.760
We'd like to thank, in particular,

04:46.840 --> 04:50.440
the Parents' Association
for sponsoring this award.

04:50.520 --> 04:53.480
The prize is a package tour to Singapore

04:53.560 --> 04:58.880
for three days and two nights,
along with a cash prize of 30,000 baht.

05:04.360 --> 05:05.520
[Aum clears throat]

05:11.400 --> 05:14.000
-Today, we'll learn about classification--
-Ma'am.

05:14.480 --> 05:15.440
Yes?

05:15.520 --> 05:18.360
Did you enjoy the volunteer camp
in Chiang Rai?

05:18.440 --> 05:20.760
Ah, it was fun. The weather was so nice.

05:20.840 --> 05:23.240
Please thank your dad for sponsoring us.

05:23.320 --> 05:24.960
Sure. I will tell him you said it.

05:25.440 --> 05:27.080
But tell us how it was.

05:27.960 --> 05:31.080
At first, I thought it was going to be
a hard journey

05:31.160 --> 05:33.440
since the plantation was so far away.

05:34.000 --> 05:37.880
But your dad prepared
amazing transportation and housing for us.

05:37.960 --> 05:41.280
Also, the locals cooked us every meal
and they were delicious.

05:41.360 --> 05:42.200
It was so much fun.

05:42.280 --> 05:44.840
The weather was amazing.
It was really foggy.

05:44.920 --> 05:46.240
[voice fading]

05:46.320 --> 05:49.000
[dreamy music playing]

05:53.600 --> 05:57.840
[inaudible talking]

06:01.480 --> 06:03.360
[school bell rings]

06:03.440 --> 06:05.800
Oh, our time is up already?

06:06.600 --> 06:08.760
That's all right.
We'll continue it in our next class.

06:09.240 --> 06:11.800
Those who have a tutoring session
with me this evening,

06:11.880 --> 06:13.520
don't be late and don't skip class.

06:13.600 --> 06:14.720
It will be on the test.

06:14.800 --> 06:16.360
Don't skip if you want good grades, okay?

06:28.800 --> 06:29.960
[Aum] All right, everyone.

06:30.040 --> 06:32.600
Please open your book to page 39.

06:38.320 --> 06:40.120
Can anyone solve this first problem?

06:40.720 --> 06:43.280
And how many methods
can we use to solve it?

06:51.920 --> 06:53.720
I don't know how to solve it.

06:54.320 --> 06:56.000
But I just wanna ask you

06:56.080 --> 06:58.000
if you liked the volunteer camp
in Chiang Rai.

06:58.920 --> 07:00.480
That's not related to this class.

07:03.040 --> 07:04.120
[table screeching]

07:13.120 --> 07:14.760
Why do we have to learn physics?

07:14.840 --> 07:15.680
It's way too hard.

07:16.480 --> 07:18.320
It's not like we'll ever use it
in real life.

07:19.480 --> 07:22.160
[Aum] I think
you are underestimating physics.

07:24.880 --> 07:26.080
But that's not news.

07:27.480 --> 07:29.440
I wouldn't be surprised if…

07:30.160 --> 07:31.320
everyone agrees.

07:33.160 --> 07:35.040
Can anyone answer Chin's question?

07:38.840 --> 07:42.360
How about the nuclear power plants
in Fukushima, or Chernobyl?

07:45.080 --> 07:47.880
In North Korea,
they're testing nuclear weapons.

07:49.960 --> 07:51.960
Don't you think these things
impact our lives?

07:55.840 --> 07:59.360
Physics affects our lives everyday.

08:00.040 --> 08:01.560
If we can understand physics,

08:02.240 --> 08:03.960
there will be no coincidences
in this world.

08:04.040 --> 08:07.080
Yeah, look what you have done, big mouth.

08:08.160 --> 08:10.440
Can anyone use a different method
to solve this problem?

08:11.760 --> 08:13.080
Come on, ma'am.

08:13.560 --> 08:15.240
I can't even understand
what's on the board.

08:15.840 --> 08:17.360
[male student]
You wanna find a different method?

08:21.120 --> 08:22.040
That's okay.

08:23.680 --> 08:25.840
This will be the homework for tonight.

08:26.720 --> 08:32.320
I want everyone to solve this problem,
but use at least one different method.

08:33.919 --> 08:34.960
And Chin,

08:35.679 --> 08:37.080
you have a special assignment.

08:39.000 --> 08:40.159
But, ma'am…

08:40.760 --> 08:44.440
Don't you think it's a little unfair
to give me extra work like that?

08:45.920 --> 08:50.960
You just have to write a report
on the role of physics in our lives.

08:51.560 --> 08:54.720
Hand the report in to me next week.
Do you understand?

08:55.920 --> 08:57.560
I… Of course.

08:58.920 --> 08:59.800
[Aum] Great.

09:00.320 --> 09:02.920
All right. Everyone, turn to page 40.

09:03.800 --> 09:04.960
We'll start at question three.

09:09.200 --> 09:11.160
You wanted to talk to me, sir?

09:16.960 --> 09:20.400
MS. PIM 136 VOTES
MS. NAM 103 VOTES

09:20.480 --> 09:24.120
MR. MENG 24 VOTES
MS. AUM 1 VOTE

09:27.640 --> 09:29.840
This survey is completely ridiculous.

09:32.560 --> 09:34.560
That's because
you're being stubborn like this.

09:35.600 --> 09:37.400
[director]
This survey isn't nonsense at all.

09:37.960 --> 09:42.680
If we can evaluate our students each term,
then they can evaluate us as well.

09:44.520 --> 09:47.200
But I think the survey is asking
all the wrong questions.

09:47.760 --> 09:49.600
Well, maybe,

09:50.480 --> 09:51.760
your harsh teaching style

09:52.760 --> 09:54.360
might be too much for the kids.

09:54.440 --> 09:56.400
Should I spend the class time
talking about myself,

09:56.920 --> 09:58.760
and then feed them exactly
what will be on the test,

09:58.840 --> 10:00.720
in exchange for tutoring fee?

10:01.280 --> 10:02.680
[Aum] Would the students
like me better, then?

10:03.240 --> 10:05.960
Would that make me more popular?

10:08.240 --> 10:10.880
How does it help the students
if all we care about is being liked?

10:13.120 --> 10:14.120
I understand,

10:14.800 --> 10:16.120
but our world has changed.

10:18.840 --> 10:19.680
[director] Ultimately,

10:20.480 --> 10:23.520
Aum, I want this for you

10:23.600 --> 10:25.800
to change your teaching style a little

10:25.880 --> 10:28.400
so the kids can understand
what your teaching better

10:29.040 --> 10:32.080
and I want you
to be more lively, you know?

10:32.680 --> 10:36.360
[director] Lately, you've seemed
really stressed out like you used to be.

10:39.000 --> 10:40.000
Is something wrong?

10:42.240 --> 10:43.280
No, nothing's wrong.

10:47.640 --> 10:49.040
Well, has…

10:51.120 --> 10:52.320
your ex-husband…

10:55.360 --> 10:56.600
contacted you at all?

10:58.560 --> 11:00.680
I've already made this clear to you.

11:00.760 --> 11:03.240
He has no part in my life anymore.

11:05.440 --> 11:07.440
My child and I are doing just fine.

11:12.080 --> 11:14.200
Well, it's almost Christmas now.

11:14.280 --> 11:17.680
I want you to be more…
more engaging in your classes.

11:17.760 --> 11:21.240
[director] Whatever happened in the past,
just leave it behind.

11:25.160 --> 11:27.760
[inaudible chatter]

11:43.200 --> 11:44.880
Try not to listen to them.

11:44.960 --> 11:46.360
It's just that…

11:46.840 --> 11:48.840
I mean, people like to gossip,
you know that.

11:50.320 --> 11:51.240
Yeah.

11:52.800 --> 11:55.640
I feel terrible about Jade,
about your ex-husband, too.

11:58.640 --> 12:01.760
[Man] He shouldn't have ruined his life
by getting a student pregnant.

12:03.000 --> 12:03.880
I…

12:05.600 --> 12:08.160
I apologize. It wasn't my intention
to make you uncomfortable.

12:11.760 --> 12:14.840
I would like to remind you
that this is my personal business.

12:14.920 --> 12:15.960
Thank you very much.

12:16.040 --> 12:17.040
Right.

12:19.240 --> 12:20.120
I…

12:20.680 --> 12:24.080
I just want to apologize
to you about Jade.

12:24.760 --> 12:26.000
[Man] I…

12:26.520 --> 12:28.480
I shouldn't have suggested that he tutor…

12:28.560 --> 12:33.040
You know, I think we should focus
on improving our educational system

12:33.600 --> 12:35.680
so we don't get a student
like that ever again.

12:35.760 --> 12:36.720
Don't you think?

12:38.720 --> 12:39.600
Yeah.

12:45.400 --> 12:46.480
[door closes]

12:48.400 --> 12:49.680
[breathes deeply]

12:52.720 --> 12:54.040
[exhales]

13:09.800 --> 13:11.160
[Nanno] Is everything all right?

13:13.240 --> 13:14.720
You look pale.

13:14.800 --> 13:16.080
You…

13:16.160 --> 13:19.200
I saw that you weren't feeling well,
so I brought you medicine.

13:21.520 --> 13:23.160
Is something bothering you?

13:23.880 --> 13:24.840
I saw you were talking to--

13:24.920 --> 13:26.680
You understand that we're having
a personal conversation.

13:26.760 --> 13:28.440
Don't eavesdrop.

13:30.120 --> 13:31.280
What are you talking about?

13:31.360 --> 13:35.160
All I heard was that you were talking
about students in our educational system.

13:35.240 --> 13:38.360
I just wanna let you know
how much I admire you.

13:38.880 --> 13:41.680
I couldn't help but say something.

13:41.760 --> 13:45.720
I don't understand why people
don't realize how rotten our system is.

13:46.440 --> 13:48.240
It's all a huge mess.

13:48.320 --> 13:50.080
Teachers like you
are the only hope we have.

13:54.320 --> 13:57.320
If you're done saying what you have
to say, you can go now.

14:06.800 --> 14:07.800
[door closes]

14:10.320 --> 14:11.320
[Aum] Hey!

14:11.920 --> 14:13.920
Where are you going?

14:14.000 --> 14:15.680
Are you really going to live
with that bitch?

14:15.760 --> 14:16.880
Are you?

14:16.960 --> 14:19.440
[boy wailing]

14:19.520 --> 14:24.680
[Aum's child] Dad, where are you going?
I want you take me with you!

14:25.920 --> 14:29.880
[child continues crying]

14:29.960 --> 14:32.000
[child wailing fades]

14:33.360 --> 14:34.480
[Aum scoffs]

14:52.720 --> 14:53.960
Mommy

14:54.040 --> 14:56.560
Do I still have to do my homework
the same way?

14:56.640 --> 14:58.680
Of course you do. Let me see.

15:04.040 --> 15:06.800
WHAT IS THE COMPOSITION OF 16?

15:08.400 --> 15:10.080
WHAT IS THE TENS DIGIT OF 18?

15:12.280 --> 15:14.160
And why do we have to do this again?

15:14.240 --> 15:17.400
Because we must find the answers
on our own.

15:19.080 --> 15:20.240
[Aum] That's right.

15:21.560 --> 15:22.960
Do you know

15:23.440 --> 15:27.000
that a good education
will be beneficial for your future?

15:28.000 --> 15:30.040
Mommy doesn't want you to grow up

15:30.640 --> 15:32.760
and act like an adult who didn't get

15:33.960 --> 15:35.800
a proper education.

15:38.080 --> 15:40.480
I will never let you be like that.
Do you hear me?

15:47.480 --> 15:48.320
Here.

15:49.400 --> 15:51.560
When an adult gives you something,
what do you say?

15:52.160 --> 15:53.720
Thank you, ma'am.

15:53.800 --> 15:56.320
[Aum chuckles]
Good boy.

16:33.280 --> 16:36.480
[keypad clicking]

16:42.160 --> 16:43.920
[keypad clicking continues]

16:46.040 --> 16:46.880
Hello?

16:55.440 --> 16:56.280
[machine beeps]

17:08.880 --> 17:10.680
[machine beeps]

17:16.560 --> 17:19.040
[cashier] It's 198 baht and 50 satang.

17:23.200 --> 17:24.440
You gave me 200 baht.

17:37.240 --> 17:39.240
You still owe me 50 satang.

17:51.920 --> 17:53.280
Which high school did you graduate from?

17:54.160 --> 17:56.320
Who trained you
to treat customers this way?

17:57.480 --> 17:59.680
My problem isn't about the 50 satang.

17:59.760 --> 18:01.760
You should've given me
the correct change in the first place.

18:02.480 --> 18:05.320
If you don't have enough change,
tell your customer that.

18:05.400 --> 18:06.560
Don't you understand?

18:07.440 --> 18:08.440
Do you want it or not?

18:10.240 --> 18:12.120
[shouting]
Did you not hear what I said?

18:12.200 --> 18:14.120
It's about you
not giving me all my change.

18:14.680 --> 18:16.040
I don't need your one baht.

18:16.120 --> 18:18.400
I need my 50 satang.
Can't you understand that?

18:18.880 --> 18:21.520
How many times do I need to repeat myself?

18:21.600 --> 18:23.440
This is common courtesy!

18:23.520 --> 18:24.920
[Aum] Do you hear me?

18:25.000 --> 18:27.760
It's common sense in business.
The customer is always right!

18:27.840 --> 18:29.640
How did you even graduate?

18:38.600 --> 18:39.440
[door slams]

18:53.880 --> 18:54.720
Atom.

18:55.840 --> 18:57.240
Stop playing with your food.

18:59.840 --> 19:03.040
Mom, sometimes I miss my dad.

19:04.840 --> 19:06.840
[Atom] I miss my dad.

19:08.480 --> 19:10.520
[Atom] I miss my dad.

19:10.600 --> 19:11.640
[shrieks]

19:11.720 --> 19:13.160
[shouting]
Just stop talking!

19:13.720 --> 19:15.680
Don't talk about him again! Understand?

19:20.200 --> 19:23.520
-You really wanna be with that dad, huh?
-[Atom wailing]

19:23.600 --> 19:25.880
Why do you want to be
with a bad person like that?

19:26.760 --> 19:31.360
A bad person
who left his son and his wife.

19:31.440 --> 19:33.120
How am I not good enough?

19:34.280 --> 19:36.280
Listen to me. Listen!

19:36.360 --> 19:40.560
Your dad is bad. A horrible man.
Understand me?

19:40.640 --> 19:43.080
[Atom wailing]

19:49.960 --> 19:52.200
[Atom breathing heavily]

19:56.760 --> 19:59.280
[Atom continues sobbing]

20:02.480 --> 20:04.360
Don't run away from me.

20:08.160 --> 20:09.400
Stay with me.

20:12.880 --> 20:14.360
I promise you that…

20:15.080 --> 20:20.640
I will never ever let you become
a bad person like your terrible father

20:22.040 --> 20:23.640
and his mistress.

20:33.200 --> 20:34.920
I promise you that.

20:44.920 --> 20:46.440
I promise you.

20:47.320 --> 20:48.640
I promise you.

20:57.920 --> 20:58.920
[cell phone beeps]

20:59.000 --> 21:00.120
[male student] Oh, shit.

21:00.200 --> 21:01.320
Whose phone was that?

21:01.400 --> 21:02.360
[Chin, whispering]
Why didn't you turn off your phone?

21:02.440 --> 21:03.400
[Ball, whispering]
I did.

21:03.480 --> 21:07.560
[cell phones beeping]

21:12.680 --> 21:13.640
[chuckles]

21:18.160 --> 21:19.000
[giggling]

21:19.600 --> 21:20.440
Oh, shit.

21:23.320 --> 21:26.000
It wasn't me, ma'am.
I have no idea where this text came from.

21:31.000 --> 21:32.200
PROFESSOR FROM A FAMOUS UNIVERSITY
WHO HAD AN AFFAIR WITH A STUDENT

21:32.280 --> 21:33.120
WILL BE EXPELLED

21:33.680 --> 21:36.640
Isn't that the guy in the news?
Is he your ex-husband?

21:40.440 --> 21:44.520
-[Ball] Oh, my god.
-He got a student pregnant.

21:44.600 --> 21:48.440
[indistinct chatter]

21:49.920 --> 21:52.360
He's a professor
but he got a student pregnant.

21:52.920 --> 21:55.320
-He just left his wife and child.
-She was dumped.

21:55.400 --> 21:58.280
[indistinct chatter]

21:58.360 --> 22:01.120
Everyone, shut up!

22:25.040 --> 22:27.160
[groaning]

22:29.760 --> 22:31.000
[groaning]

22:39.160 --> 22:42.520
Aum, I think you should spend
the day resting.

22:45.160 --> 22:46.560
What happened to me?

22:47.640 --> 22:51.040
You passed out after seeing
the picture on the phone.

22:53.200 --> 22:55.880
So… Every student is talking about it now.

22:56.960 --> 22:58.480
[director] I want you to take a break

22:59.080 --> 23:00.240
until the news quiets down.

23:01.000 --> 23:02.840
Come back to work after that.

23:04.320 --> 23:05.800
That will be better for you.

23:07.440 --> 23:08.440
Just trust me.

23:10.720 --> 23:11.720
I won't.

23:13.640 --> 23:16.800
I won't stop teaching
because of somebody else's mistake.

23:18.040 --> 23:22.000
Also, I probably fainted
because I have been working too hard.

23:22.080 --> 23:27.280
My plans to reform the educational system
will change everything.

23:27.760 --> 23:30.160
[Aum] If I have a chance to be
the deputy director…

23:30.960 --> 23:34.000
You put your educational plan
on my desk this morning.

23:34.080 --> 23:34.960
Isn't that right?

23:36.560 --> 23:39.080
I read it. It's interesting.

23:40.000 --> 23:42.560
But I think our school
might not be the best fit

23:42.640 --> 23:44.960
for a radical plan like yours.

23:49.880 --> 23:54.560
Pim's plan to reform the system
is popular among the other teachers

23:55.400 --> 23:58.000
and the Parents' Association approved it.

24:01.000 --> 24:04.360
I don't want you to worry
about that kind of thing.

24:04.440 --> 24:06.280
I'm asking you to let go of all that.

24:10.480 --> 24:13.160
As for the position
of the deputy director,

24:13.720 --> 24:14.880
[director] I think…

24:16.360 --> 24:19.360
there may be someone who is…

24:20.640 --> 24:21.720
more suitable.

24:26.840 --> 24:28.200
I shouldn't bother you.

24:29.800 --> 24:30.760
Please rest.

24:59.120 --> 25:00.720
Is everything all right?

25:02.080 --> 25:04.080
[Nanno] You seem so stressed lately.

25:04.760 --> 25:06.240
And you stay after school every day.

25:07.120 --> 25:08.320
Are you preparing for a class?

25:11.480 --> 25:13.080
If you're done talking, you can leave now.

25:16.040 --> 25:17.160
I need to work.

25:19.520 --> 25:21.920
Did I do something wrong? Please tell me.

25:22.600 --> 25:24.360
Why do I always feel like

25:25.200 --> 25:26.960
you don't like me at all?

25:29.640 --> 25:31.080
But I guess it's okay.

25:32.480 --> 25:36.440
At least, we are lucky to have
someone like you in our school.

25:38.040 --> 25:39.160
[Nanno] It's hard to find…

25:39.680 --> 25:42.880
a teacher who would do so much
for the students.

25:45.480 --> 25:48.560
If you become the deputy director,

25:49.920 --> 25:52.360
[Nanno] our school will be so much better.

25:53.560 --> 25:54.720
Don't you agree?

25:57.680 --> 25:59.000
That's all I have to say.

25:59.560 --> 26:01.400
I won't take up any more of your time.

26:11.720 --> 26:14.760
[suspenseful music]

26:50.040 --> 26:53.160
Someone like you
will never be the deputy director.

26:53.240 --> 26:55.080
[director laughs]

26:57.480 --> 26:59.880
Take a look at yourself, really.

26:59.960 --> 27:02.400
It's amazing that they haven't fired you.

27:14.880 --> 27:17.480
[indistinct chatter]

27:18.080 --> 27:20.480
[indistinct chatter]

27:21.360 --> 27:24.640
[indistinct chatter]

27:24.720 --> 27:27.680
[indistinct chatter]

27:28.360 --> 27:31.400
-[Ball] Look. There she is.
-[Chin] She's so pathetic.

27:31.480 --> 27:34.040
-She got dumped and she got fired.
-[Ball laughs]

27:34.120 --> 27:35.360
[both laugh]

27:35.440 --> 27:37.600
[Chin] Your husband has a mistress.

27:37.680 --> 27:38.920
[Ball] You really suck.

27:40.520 --> 27:43.040
-[Chin] Your husband has a mistress.
-[Ball laughs]

28:09.160 --> 28:10.000
[smashes]

28:12.080 --> 28:13.600
[crowd screaming]

28:13.680 --> 28:15.640
Hey! What the fuck!

28:16.920 --> 28:18.360
Get the nurse. Come on!

28:18.440 --> 28:20.080
[crowd screaming]

28:20.160 --> 28:21.320
Hurry up!

28:22.760 --> 28:25.120
She stabbed Chin. She does!

28:25.200 --> 28:28.520
[wailing]

28:42.200 --> 28:43.120
You are aware

28:44.080 --> 28:47.040
[director] that Chin's father
is the main sponsor of our school, right?

28:49.280 --> 28:50.240
You are lucky.

28:51.320 --> 28:54.040
I talked him out
of pressing charges against you.

28:56.440 --> 28:58.240
[director] I warned you before.

29:00.200 --> 29:03.400
I told you, you needed to take a break,
but you didn't listen to me.

29:06.600 --> 29:07.920
I'm really sorry.

29:18.280 --> 29:20.720
-[students] Choice C.
-[Pim] Next.

29:20.800 --> 29:22.320
[students] It's choice A.

29:22.400 --> 29:24.400
[Pim] What's the answer to question 33?

29:24.480 --> 29:26.480
[students] Choice B.

29:26.560 --> 29:27.680
What about question 34?

29:27.760 --> 29:28.800
[students] Choice A.

29:29.360 --> 29:31.840
Don't be fooled. The answer is C.

29:32.760 --> 29:34.400
[Pim] How about question 35?

29:34.480 --> 29:36.000
[students] Choice D.

29:36.080 --> 29:37.320
[Pim] And the next one?

29:37.400 --> 29:38.840
[students] Choice A.

29:38.920 --> 29:41.720
-[Pim] 39?
-[students] Choice C.

29:41.800 --> 29:44.480
-[Pim] Question 40?
-[students] Choice C.

29:44.560 --> 29:47.560
-[Pim] Question 41?
-[students] Choice C.

29:48.520 --> 29:50.040
[students] Choice C.

29:50.560 --> 29:52.400
[students] Choice C.

29:53.160 --> 29:54.320
[students] Choice C.

29:54.400 --> 29:55.440
Hello there.

29:55.520 --> 29:56.920
[students] Choice C.

29:57.920 --> 29:59.240
[students] Choice C.

30:01.640 --> 30:03.240
You can't give up like this.

30:06.960 --> 30:08.520
If you don't do anything,

30:09.240 --> 30:11.720
our school will keep rotting on the
inside.

30:13.040 --> 30:13.880
And then,

30:14.920 --> 30:18.640
children will grow up
with this shitty education.

30:19.440 --> 30:20.560
Do you want that to happen?

30:26.160 --> 30:28.360
You have to do better than this.

30:57.920 --> 30:59.040
[cell phone beeps]

31:05.280 --> 31:06.440
SHOCKING!

31:06.520 --> 31:08.960
CRAZY TEACHER STABBED
MALE STUDENT IN SCHOOL

31:09.040 --> 31:10.840
ANOTHER INCIDENT AGAIN.
WHAT A BAD TEACHER!

31:10.920 --> 31:12.920
SHE THOUGHT SHE CAN DO ANYTHING
JUST BECAUSE SHE'S A TEACHER?

31:13.000 --> 31:14.720
IS SHE THE WIFE OF THE PROFESSOR
WHO GOT A STUDENT PREGNANT?

31:14.800 --> 31:16.280
THEY ARE BOTH EVIL!

31:16.360 --> 31:18.000
I'LL SPREAD THE NEWS,
SO THEIR CAREER PATHS WILL BE DOOMED!

31:18.080 --> 31:19.280
HOW DID THEY BECOME TEACHERS?

31:19.360 --> 31:20.480
THEY SHOULDN'T HAVE BEEN BORN.

31:20.560 --> 31:21.720
I WISH THEIR CHILD WILL BE SCREWED.

31:21.800 --> 31:22.720
GO FUCK YOURSELVES, BAD TEACHERS!

31:23.880 --> 31:27.600
[director] I think your teaching style
might be too harsh for the kids.

31:28.840 --> 31:31.880
Someone like you
will never be the deputy director.

31:31.960 --> 31:34.680
-[director laughs]
-[Pim] Take a look at yourself.

31:35.600 --> 31:38.320
[Pim] Pathetic.
[laughs]

31:41.880 --> 31:43.160
[Aum] Where are you going?

31:43.240 --> 31:45.320
Are you going with that bitch?

31:53.640 --> 31:57.920
Dad, where are you going?
Take me with you.

31:58.000 --> 32:00.560
[Atom] I don't want to live with Mom.
[wailing]

32:03.120 --> 32:06.040
-Why do you want to be with a bad person?
-I want to live with Dad.

32:06.640 --> 32:09.800
I don't wanna live with you.
[sobbing]

32:09.880 --> 32:11.840
[Aum] Shut up! Shut the fuck up!

32:12.400 --> 32:14.120
Shut your fucking mouth!

32:14.200 --> 32:18.800
-[Atom wailing]
-Shut up! No Shut up! Shut the fuck up!

32:18.880 --> 32:22.840
I feel sorry for her. She lost her husband
and now, she lost her son.

32:22.920 --> 32:25.120
[Aum] Shut up! I said shut up!

32:26.160 --> 32:28.160
My child and I are doing just fine.

32:30.520 --> 32:33.040
No! Shut up!

32:33.120 --> 32:34.640
Please don't leave me.

32:35.200 --> 32:37.160
I love you so much.

32:54.040 --> 32:56.920
[humming "Twelve Days of Christmas"]

33:15.600 --> 33:18.120
["Twelve Days of Christmas"
instrumental version playing]

33:18.200 --> 33:20.760
GREETING AREA

33:47.760 --> 33:50.240
[song continues playing]

34:03.360 --> 34:09.040
We will also now announce the winner
of the best teacher award for this year,

34:09.120 --> 34:12.080
who will also be named
the new deputy director.

34:12.159 --> 34:13.600
This award goes to…

34:22.400 --> 34:24.679
[somber music playing]

34:57.720 --> 35:00.480
[director] Excuse me, Aum.
What are you doing here?

35:00.560 --> 35:03.360
[humming "Twelve Days of Christmas"]

35:15.240 --> 35:17.640
[students screaming]

35:17.720 --> 35:20.280
[humming continues]

35:20.360 --> 35:21.640
[gun cocks]

35:21.720 --> 35:22.840
[gunshot]

35:22.920 --> 35:27.040
["Twelve Days of Christmas"
orchestral version playing]

35:54.240 --> 35:57.280
[song continues playing]

36:03.160 --> 36:04.080
[gunshot]

36:05.360 --> 36:06.640
WORAWEE PRASITIKULPAISARN
THE MOST DISCIPLINED STUDENT

36:07.240 --> 36:08.160
[gunshot]

36:29.520 --> 36:33.280
[gun cocking repeatedly]

36:33.360 --> 36:35.120
[song fades]

36:56.320 --> 36:57.480
I just realized

36:58.080 --> 37:00.960
how beautiful and peaceful this place is.

37:01.480 --> 37:02.480
Is that right?

37:04.840 --> 37:06.320
But this is not the end.

37:07.200 --> 37:08.800
Of course it's not the end.

37:09.560 --> 37:12.640
After this one,
there will be other schools.

37:14.120 --> 37:15.640
Do you think what you did here today

37:16.480 --> 37:18.200
will change the whole system?

37:20.080 --> 37:22.120
You know, I need to thank you, Nanno,

37:22.960 --> 37:24.520
for making me understand.

37:42.360 --> 37:43.280
[gun cocks]

37:53.840 --> 37:55.400
Are you going to kill me too?

37:56.680 --> 37:58.120
Don't you want revenge?

38:02.800 --> 38:04.200
I can't help it.

38:05.400 --> 38:06.400
Because…

38:07.520 --> 38:09.160
look too much like that bitch.

38:11.640 --> 38:12.800
What about the others?

38:18.640 --> 38:20.040
I did it for everyone.

38:21.080 --> 38:22.480
Don't you see that?

38:22.560 --> 38:23.800
These people…

38:24.680 --> 38:27.480
They're ruining the educational system
for all of us.

38:28.680 --> 38:31.160
I'll fix it for everyone.

38:31.240 --> 38:32.120
[scoffs]

38:34.160 --> 38:35.160
Because…

38:35.960 --> 38:38.520
I'm not a teacher
who only teaches in the classroom.

38:41.440 --> 38:43.960
Is this really your plan
to reform the education?

38:49.960 --> 38:51.160
Or maybe…

38:52.920 --> 38:55.200
you are a loser who failed in life

38:56.480 --> 38:57.600
and decided to blame

38:58.400 --> 38:59.560
the system.

39:01.080 --> 39:02.480
You think you're right

39:03.160 --> 39:04.920
when in fact, you're selfish.

39:07.720 --> 39:08.840
Sometimes,

39:09.760 --> 39:11.720
the people who think they're always right

39:14.000 --> 39:15.960
are really the most pathetic.

39:16.520 --> 39:17.800
[shouting]
Shut the fuck up!

39:17.880 --> 39:20.400
[breathing heavily]

39:22.360 --> 39:23.440
I did the right thing.

39:25.200 --> 39:26.560
I did it for everyone.

39:28.160 --> 39:29.400
I'm a good person.

39:30.680 --> 39:31.800
I did the right thing.

39:33.680 --> 39:35.040
I did it for everyone.

39:36.040 --> 39:37.240
I'm a good person.

39:37.920 --> 39:39.560
[chuckling]

39:40.800 --> 39:42.080
I did the right thing.

39:42.680 --> 39:44.320
I did it for everyone.

39:45.560 --> 39:46.400
[gunshot]

39:52.120 --> 39:54.120
[theme music]

41:01.120 --> 41:04.160
Subtitle translation by
Pet-chompoo Sa-ngarmangkang
